A separate paper introduces a type 2 signal detection theory framework to measure

00:09:13.200 --> 00:09:19.360
metacognitive efficiency using metadee and M-ratio. They show that metacognitive efficiency varies

00:09:19.360 --> 00:09:24.380
dramatically across models even when raw accuracy looks similar and that efficiency is highly

00:09:24.380 --> 00:09:30.540
domain specific. Temperature mostly shifts decision criterion rather than sensitivity. Perhaps

